    "referenced_message": {
      "type": 19,
      "content": "Yes, of course Toolbox is awesome as it tracks shiny pets progress and shows time to rank up automatically <:happy:644766908218081300> So you might think this sheet is useless. However here pets are sorted by bonus which I like a bit more (you see a bonus and all the pets which provide it) and it allows some manual calculations (how much time it would take to level up a pet till certain level or how fast your pets will level up if you get more levels for +% faster shiny level up pets). Made this sheet for myself first but then thought it would be good to share it with the others in case some people like this sorting as well 😅 Was inspired by SolarFrost's Shiny Pets Effects picture btw <:hearto:899232846475063336>",
